  "details": "Allow world creators to define a zone within a world that will show the same users, physics objects, voice, and tagged udon variables, across all instances of the same world or all worlds owned by the same group. \n\nHost/Spectator instances could be set by the world creator/group admin via some ui (probably best suited for the website) \n\nuse cases:\n\n-a group event world is full but the talent or person(s) of interest are replicated to all instances along with the URL in their video player. This makes \"overflow\" worlds automatic to setup and feel closer to the main world.\n\n-if a talent or talents who may not be down for user interaction or who may not be native to VR can perform in closed instances but still perform to many.",
